    "extractedText": "Numérique et didactique \n3.5. La démarche de conception itérative \n \nD’accardo Nathalie – Esposito Julien – Shreurs Aurélie – Van Dijk Mariëlle – Vromen Gérard \n \nLien vers le Genially – Le tri des déchets :  \n \nhttps://emea01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fview.genially.com%2F6acb0c8379b28\n3199fc52834&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cd31213e709334805506c08df284969dc%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaa\naaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639273967918796764%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOn\nRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C\n&sdata=tw90TlQ6p16shIlQD8FOZr9govSVQRGYQ6C2wZKFXpk%3D&reserved=0 \n \nLien vers le questionnaire GoogleForms :  \n \nhttps://emea01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fforms%2Fd%2F\ne%2F1FAIpQLSeq5O8X_7Nvbx4uhIKZVzqoaw05nSM-\nHXWTmcu6cxcqcflL_A%2Fviewform%3Fusp%3Dpublish-\neditor&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cab99c252db10471c1bad08df2849717b%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaa\naaa%7C1%7C0%7C639273968049624256%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWU\nsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=\naKzWcDAJnKwIPVjDx9nda%2FSVU3YZ1c5XJZOTKUFfLfM%3D&reserved=0 \n \n \nGroupe :  \n \nD’accardo Nathalie \nEsposito Julien \nShreurs Aurélie \nVan Dijk Mariëlle \nVromen Gérard",
