    "answer": "Google forms\nhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScTJIvLL2wkesDkV0Tp6MyTY91VJqPOuDYL9Jl2KX24dFFhDg/viewform?usp=header\nGenialy\nhttps://view.genially.com/6acca92aced5b93ae1804504",
    "content": "Google forms\nhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScTJIvLL2wkesDkV0Tp6MyTY91VJqPOuDYL9Jl2KX24dFFhDg/viewform?usp=header\nGenialy\nhttps://view.genially.com/6acca92aced5b93ae1804504",
